WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 31]

01:49.020 --> 01:49.750
What is that?

01:49.979 --> 01:51.860
I can't believe the Brahma Tree is glowing.

01:51.860 --> 01:52.920
-Look. -This is...

01:53.420 --> 01:55.140
My Lord's demon power.

01:56.100 --> 01:57.100
What is My Lord

01:57.140 --> 01:58.420
looking for?

01:59.660 --> 02:01.100
It seems so messy.

02:01.490 --> 02:04.020
He even used his spiritual power.

02:35.500 --> 02:36.900
The Baffling Star Stone.

02:42.450 --> 02:43.460
This medicine

02:43.730 --> 02:45.579
may help Liu Shao.

02:51.660 --> 02:52.420
Liu Shao.

02:52.740 --> 02:53.960
You've come to the right person.

02:53.960 --> 02:56.400
[The Six-star Brilliant Array]

02:54.220 --> 02:54.680
Come on.

02:54.820 --> 02:56.820
Show me your precious ancient book.

02:57.620 --> 02:59.180
The Six-star Brilliant Array

02:59.180 --> 03:01.440
will not be available until the eclipse.

03:01.860 --> 03:02.660
It's not hard.

03:03.060 --> 03:04.820
The eclipse is in three days.

03:05.370 --> 03:06.170
It's perfect.

03:06.420 --> 03:06.980
Really?

03:08.020 --> 03:08.860
But this array

03:08.940 --> 03:10.340
seals the divine spirit,

03:10.460 --> 03:13.620
which is more difficult than the Demon King sealing the Immortal Ze Shui.

03:13.620 --> 03:15.580
And we need the help of the masters of three palaces.

03:15.580 --> 03:16.980
It's not easy.

03:17.340 --> 03:18.220
Don't worry.

03:18.460 --> 03:20.140
I'll talk to

03:20.300 --> 03:22.420
my senior sister and the old Immortal Master.

03:22.420 --> 03:23.220
Besides,

03:23.579 --> 03:24.980
the eclipse is still a few days away.

03:24.980 --> 03:26.510
I don't want him to feel bad.

03:27.220 --> 03:28.060
If you would

03:28.220 --> 03:30.100
tell Luo Ge about this,

03:30.220 --> 03:31.880
it would be much less trouble.

03:33.530 --> 03:34.260
No.

03:35.300 --> 03:36.250
I have to

03:36.860 --> 03:38.190
deal with this on my own.

03:39.460 --> 03:40.340
He

03:40.340 --> 03:43.340
probably wants your powers to stop working against each other.

03:43.340 --> 03:44.140
Senior sister,

03:44.140 --> 03:45.660
the Immortal Master agreed.

03:45.660 --> 03:47.500
Please help Liu Shao.

03:51.060 --> 03:51.810
I can

03:51.810 --> 03:52.740
help her.

03:53.460 --> 03:54.180
But,

03:55.500 --> 03:56.380
it's just...

03:56.460 --> 03:57.660
If Luo Ge picks on you,

03:57.660 --> 03:58.860
what are you gonna do?

04:01.180 --> 04:03.910
There's something wrong when you put it that way.

04:04.580 --> 04:06.260
Maybe Luo Ge already knew.

04:07.180 --> 04:08.740
He already knew?

04:09.340 --> 04:10.460
What would you do

04:10.460 --> 04:11.860
if you got the wrong idea?

04:13.580 --> 04:14.900
When you put it that way,

04:14.900 --> 04:16.430
things are a little tricky.

04:17.579 --> 04:19.180
But when Luo Ge came out of the Yin-yang Cave,

04:19.180 --> 04:19.980
he told us to find a way

04:19.980 --> 04:21.510
to nourish Liu Shao's body.

04:21.779 --> 04:23.130
I think he already knew

04:23.530 --> 04:24.990
and wanted to be prepared.

04:25.420 --> 04:26.180
Really?

04:27.820 --> 04:28.660
Liu Shao.

04:28.980 --> 04:30.580
Are you really ready

04:31.780 --> 04:33.060
for the seal tomorrow?

04:36.100 --> 04:38.180
Shang Yurong helped me get the Immortal Master

04:38.180 --> 04:39.540
and Master Zhuo to help.

04:39.980 --> 04:41.240
It shouldn't go wrong.

04:41.820 --> 04:42.250
Okay.

04:43.659 --> 04:44.920
Then I'll eat the melon

04:45.140 --> 04:46.140
and cheer for you.

04:49.380 --> 04:51.659
But I still can't rest easy.

04:51.780 --> 04:54.420
I still feel like something is gonna happen.

04:55.100 --> 04:56.860
Is there something

04:56.860 --> 04:58.720
the God of the Sun wants to tell me?

04:59.540 --> 05:01.060
It has been bothering me.

05:01.740 --> 05:02.850
The God of the Sun

05:03.050 --> 05:04.510
doesn't want me to seal it?

05:05.860 --> 05:08.060
I don't think you've figured it out yet.

05:08.930 --> 05:10.140
Sun Spirit

05:10.300 --> 05:12.340
is not a good thing at all.

05:13.380 --> 05:14.840
Let's not talk about that.

05:15.180 --> 05:16.860
When your seal is done,

05:16.860 --> 05:19.500
you and my brother are no longer at odds.

05:20.020 --> 05:22.660
And then you can be together.

05:26.810 --> 05:28.420
Even if Luo Ge knows,

05:28.900 --> 05:30.370
he would be happy.

05:35.500 --> 05:38.020
How did the Bone Melting Pool suddenly so much evil spirits?

05:38.020 --> 05:39.750
Go and ask the Immortal Master.

05:45.490 --> 05:46.220
Master Zhuo.

05:47.340 --> 05:48.200
What happened?

05:49.020 --> 05:51.140
General Xie said he's going to worship his junior sister today.

05:51.140 --> 05:52.140
Soon after he left,

05:52.140 --> 05:54.300
the evil spirits inside suddenly began to change.

05:54.300 --> 05:55.340
So we reported it to the Immortal Mater.

05:55.340 --> 05:57.300
We wanted other generals to help us.

05:57.300 --> 05:58.830
I didn't realize it was you.

05:59.170 --> 06:00.230
You guys wait here.

06:00.540 --> 06:01.400
I'll go inside.

06:01.900 --> 06:02.530
Yes.

06:32.340 --> 06:33.820
Zhuo Qiuxian.

06:34.380 --> 06:35.020
Oh, no.

06:35.380 --> 06:37.260
Master Zhuo.

06:37.260 --> 06:38.700
Who's running wild here?

06:41.220 --> 06:42.650
How presumptuous!

06:43.620 --> 06:44.500
Master Zhuo,

06:45.300 --> 06:46.940
you are on a roll now.

06:47.340 --> 06:48.700
You've forgotten

06:48.700 --> 06:49.860
your master's last words, right?

06:49.860 --> 06:51.180
It has nothing to do with my master.

06:51.180 --> 06:52.260
Am I wrong?

06:52.900 --> 06:55.380
If Lord Shang saw his only son

06:55.380 --> 06:57.980
had always been a general for a thousand years,

06:58.180 --> 07:00.090
would he be disappointed?

07:00.780 --> 07:01.770
Nonsense!

07:04.780 --> 07:05.540
By then,

07:06.300 --> 07:08.580
will you still have the momentum?

07:10.460 --> 07:11.300
Get lost!

07:15.180 --> 07:16.110
What's going on?

07:16.820 --> 07:18.950
Why am I having these hallucinations?

07:39.740 --> 07:41.540
There's something wrong with the Bone Melting Pool.

07:41.540 --> 07:43.420
You need to be on your guard at all times.

07:43.420 --> 07:44.620
If anything goes wrong,

07:44.620 --> 07:45.659
report it immediately.

07:45.659 --> 07:46.320
-Yes. -Yes.

08:13.780 --> 08:14.420
Liu Shao.

08:15.500 --> 08:16.230
Don't worry.

08:16.370 --> 08:18.370
I have your Tears of the Half-Demon.

08:18.420 --> 08:18.900
Yes.

08:19.460 --> 08:20.370
You can do it.

09:27.020 --> 09:28.740
The sealing process

09:29.540 --> 09:30.420
of the Sun Spirit

09:30.420 --> 09:31.860
is extremely dangerous.

09:33.020 --> 09:34.740
If you regret it now,

09:34.770 --> 09:35.900
it's not too late.

09:37.140 --> 09:37.670
Liu Shao.

09:38.100 --> 09:39.740
You need to think this through.

09:39.740 --> 09:40.740
After all,

09:41.260 --> 09:44.060
the seal of the divine spirit is never done before.

09:45.890 --> 09:46.820
I'm very clear.

09:48.340 --> 09:49.380
For the Three Realms,

09:49.380 --> 09:50.180
and for Luo Ge,

09:50.530 --> 09:51.660
this is my decision.

10:52.580 --> 10:53.340
They are

10:55.020 --> 10:56.550
sealing the divine spirit.

11:09.860 --> 11:12.460
The divine spirit is resisting the formation.

11:16.890 --> 11:17.740
Go on.

11:18.300 --> 11:18.980
Change!

11:44.700 --> 11:46.340
You are on a roll now.

11:47.820 --> 11:49.260
You've forgotten

11:49.260 --> 11:51.120
your master's last words, right?

12:22.980 --> 12:24.980
You're not gonna get away with this!

13:09.940 --> 13:11.620
The weapon of the God of the Sun,

13:11.620 --> 13:12.420
Crown Wheel.

13:13.820 --> 13:16.350
I can't believe you summoned the Crown Wheel.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.430
You're sure you're up against me,

13:20.660 --> 13:23.120
not the one under the Four Seasons Monument?

13:31.180 --> 13:33.380
Why did the Crown Wheel attack Qiuxian?

13:34.420 --> 13:35.750
Looks like Zhuo Qiuxian

13:36.060 --> 13:37.980
has been affected by the evil spirit.

13:37.980 --> 13:38.500
Luo Ge!

13:38.860 --> 13:39.860
I can't keep it up!

13:39.940 --> 13:40.900
Help me!

14:14.580 --> 14:15.380
Shang Yurong.

14:15.940 --> 14:17.620
Get your senior sister settled

14:17.620 --> 14:19.550
and meet me at the Palace Chonghua.

14:34.860 --> 14:35.820
Luo Ge.

14:36.420 --> 14:37.820
Was the seal successful?

14:40.900 --> 14:41.540
Liu Shao.

14:42.820 --> 14:43.260
Is it

14:44.420 --> 14:45.130
worth it?

14:47.940 --> 14:50.380
As long as you no longer suffer because of me,

14:50.380 --> 14:52.220
as long as our spiritual powers no longer collide,

14:52.220 --> 14:53.420
I think it's worth it.

14:54.380 --> 14:55.900
Sun Spirit was your chance

14:58.020 --> 14:59.700
to advance your mana.

15:02.540 --> 15:04.140
I don't expect anything from that.

15:04.140 --> 15:05.780
You know me, don't you?

15:06.220 --> 15:08.780
All I want is to be with you.

15:11.740 --> 15:13.200
It would certainly be best

15:14.130 --> 15:15.410
if we were together.

15:16.620 --> 15:18.350
But we not only have each other,

15:18.820 --> 15:20.620
but also the whole Three Realms.

15:22.940 --> 15:24.340
But you're all I got.

15:25.540 --> 15:28.060
I know you're responsible for the Three Realms.

15:28.060 --> 15:29.260
I can't affect you.

15:29.420 --> 15:31.420
Isn't this the best of both worlds?

15:34.740 --> 15:36.540
I just don't think it's worth it.

15:37.740 --> 15:38.340
Actually,

15:39.100 --> 15:40.430
you should understand.

15:42.460 --> 15:43.860
But I think it's worth it.

15:47.740 --> 15:49.400
Speaking of the Three Realms,

15:49.580 --> 15:51.740
how about I take you to the mortal world to have a look?

15:51.740 --> 15:52.780
You could see

15:53.010 --> 15:53.900
how precious

15:54.340 --> 15:55.400
your Sun Spirit is.

15:56.660 --> 15:57.340
Okay.

16:21.580 --> 16:22.180
Senior.

16:24.100 --> 16:24.740
Senior.

16:25.140 --> 16:25.940
You're awake.

16:27.460 --> 16:28.220
Rong.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.060
What happened?

16:31.260 --> 16:32.620
Well, well...

16:32.900 --> 16:35.900
There was a problem sealing Liu Shao's divine spirit.

16:39.450 --> 16:41.450
You're not gonna get away with this!

16:48.260 --> 16:49.770
I almost ruined the formation

16:49.770 --> 16:50.830
and killed Liu Wei?

16:52.690 --> 16:53.500
No, no.

16:54.100 --> 16:55.030
Liu Shao's fine.

16:55.500 --> 16:57.060
She has Luo Ge watching over her.

16:57.060 --> 16:58.220
How could it go wrong?

16:58.220 --> 16:59.620
Wasn't that an accident?

17:00.100 --> 17:01.960
If Luo Ge hadn't showed up in time,

17:02.060 --> 17:03.340
Liu Shao might have...

17:05.780 --> 17:07.380
What happened to me that day?

17:08.780 --> 17:09.380
Senior.

17:10.180 --> 17:10.910
Don't worry.

17:11.579 --> 17:12.300
I've asked.

17:14.260 --> 17:16.390
When you were in the Bone Melting Pool,

17:16.900 --> 17:19.140
you were accidentally affected by the evil spirits.

17:19.140 --> 17:19.900
So...

17:21.060 --> 17:22.920
So you got caught up in the moment.

17:25.260 --> 17:26.540
What?

17:28.580 --> 17:29.310
Impossible.

17:30.140 --> 17:30.870
Impossible.

17:31.780 --> 17:32.850
My mind is complete.

17:32.850 --> 17:34.420
How could I get caught up?

17:35.340 --> 17:36.140
I know.

17:36.860 --> 17:37.860
Don't be nervous.

17:38.180 --> 17:40.100
Let me get you a cup of tea.

17:44.660 --> 17:47.420
Shang Yurong hasn't become an immortal yet,

17:48.300 --> 17:50.230
which embarrassed the Lord Shang.

17:50.860 --> 17:53.060
Luo Ge kept him down very badly.

17:53.780 --> 17:55.980
Where would he get a promotion?

17:58.020 --> 17:59.420
You can't affect my Rong.

18:11.420 --> 18:12.100
Senior!

18:13.500 --> 18:13.980
Senior!

18:16.140 --> 18:16.700
Senior!

18:19.020 --> 18:19.690
How can there be

18:19.690 --> 18:22.490
such strong evil spirits in the Bone Melting Pool?

18:30.980 --> 18:32.510
Your senior has recovered.

18:36.290 --> 18:36.780
Senior.

18:40.660 --> 18:43.220
The evil spirit that affected Master Zhuo's mind

18:43.220 --> 18:44.980
should have come from the Four Seasons Monument.

18:44.980 --> 18:47.340
Someone had broken through Master Zhuo's defense

18:47.340 --> 18:48.740
and confused her mind

18:49.220 --> 18:50.580
under the cover of the Bone Melting Pool's evil spirits.

18:50.580 --> 18:51.210
But,

18:51.460 --> 18:53.500
my senior has been diligent in her practice.

18:53.500 --> 18:55.830
How can she be confused by the evil spirit?

19:00.300 --> 19:01.500
The evil spirit

19:02.500 --> 19:04.360
comes from personal attachment.

19:05.660 --> 19:07.140
Your senior had a lot on her shoulders

19:07.140 --> 19:09.200
and ended up in the grip of obsession.

19:09.820 --> 19:10.900
It's natural that

19:11.940 --> 19:13.340
she did something wrong.

19:15.100 --> 19:16.060
I'm the reason

19:16.500 --> 19:17.540
she's like this.

19:19.140 --> 19:19.980
Shang Yurong.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.500
At this time,

19:23.380 --> 19:25.910
I feel as if the evil spirit has been awakened.

19:26.500 --> 19:27.020
But

19:28.580 --> 19:29.980
it was meant to weaken me.

19:31.420 --> 19:33.550
I'm taking Liu Shao away for a few days.

19:33.660 --> 19:34.730
I need your help,

19:35.980 --> 19:37.180
so I can walk away.

19:39.380 --> 19:40.300
I'm going there

19:41.380 --> 19:42.910
to find a suitable solution

19:43.940 --> 19:45.180
to the evil spirit

19:47.060 --> 19:48.590
for the current situation.

19:50.860 --> 19:51.460
Maybe

19:52.780 --> 19:54.500
I can get an unexpected boost.

20:05.810 --> 20:07.740
You're thinking about Shao again?

20:09.780 --> 20:10.540
Look at you.

20:11.660 --> 20:12.980
What do you have to worry about

20:12.980 --> 20:14.780
when Shao's in Immortal Palace?

20:15.340 --> 20:16.620
Shao is lucky

20:16.740 --> 20:18.340
to go to the Immortal Palace.

20:18.540 --> 20:20.200
No one else could ask for that.

20:21.460 --> 20:22.010
Oh,

20:23.340 --> 20:24.460
my little girl.

20:24.460 --> 20:26.940
How nice to have you by my side.

20:26.940 --> 20:27.460
Dad!

20:28.220 --> 20:29.420
I'm back!

20:31.860 --> 20:32.180
Dad! Mom!

20:32.180 --> 20:32.820
Shao!

20:33.220 --> 20:34.100
Shao!

20:35.060 --> 20:36.740
My little Shao!

20:37.620 --> 20:38.420
Shao!

20:38.780 --> 20:39.820
Shao!

20:41.180 --> 20:41.860
Shao!

20:41.900 --> 20:42.700
Shao!

20:42.860 --> 20:44.260
Is this our Shao?

20:45.020 --> 20:46.020
Shao.

20:46.500 --> 20:47.820
Our Shao has made it big

20:48.020 --> 20:49.700
and became a fairy now.

20:51.010 --> 20:53.260
I came back to see you today.

20:53.420 --> 20:54.350
And I brought...

20:56.380 --> 20:56.900
Luo Ge.

20:57.300 --> 20:58.820
I need you to meet my parents.

20:58.820 --> 20:59.150
Okay.

21:06.380 --> 21:07.100
Lu Li!

21:07.860 --> 21:08.820
No!

21:08.820 --> 21:10.950
He is the immortal of Immortal Palace.

21:11.100 --> 21:12.380
Hello, Immortal.

21:12.700 --> 21:13.740
Thank you

21:13.820 --> 21:15.150
for taking care of Shao.

21:15.170 --> 21:16.780
My daughter is very promising.

21:16.780 --> 21:19.020
She's not only an immortal disciple who guards the mortal world,

21:19.020 --> 21:20.820
but also led the Immortal home.

21:27.940 --> 21:28.740
Do you know?

21:29.180 --> 21:31.020
This is the place when I first

21:31.100 --> 21:32.410
met an Immortal when I was a child.

21:32.410 --> 21:33.100
So,

21:33.780 --> 21:35.240
this is where you started,

21:35.460 --> 21:36.720
changing your destiny

21:37.060 --> 21:39.260
and becoming the guardian of the Three Realms?

21:39.260 --> 21:40.320
What you just said,

21:40.980 --> 21:43.110
the Immortal told me exactly the same.

21:54.740 --> 21:55.660
Wang Jian

21:56.340 --> 21:58.670
made a special appointment with us today.

22:04.260 --> 22:05.140
Liu Shao!

22:10.980 --> 22:11.910
Immortal Luo Ge.

22:14.820 --> 22:16.060
Since my brother came back,

22:16.060 --> 22:17.220
I've been remembering

22:17.220 --> 22:19.020
to send someone here to clean up.

22:20.220 --> 22:21.280
-Cheers! -Cheers!

22:26.700 --> 22:28.380
You're the only one taking the credit.

22:28.380 --> 22:29.910
You don't have to remember.

22:30.060 --> 22:31.460
Someone will clean it up.

22:32.220 --> 22:33.140
Brother, sister-in-law.

22:33.140 --> 22:34.070
You have no idea.

22:34.580 --> 22:36.460
Since you went back to Immortal Palace,

22:36.460 --> 22:38.190
this place has become a shrine.

22:38.460 --> 22:41.120
People come here every day to pray for good luck.

22:43.940 --> 22:45.180
What did you two do?

22:45.780 --> 22:46.500
Nothing.

22:47.620 --> 22:48.820
I just spread the story of

22:48.820 --> 22:50.500
how the Immortal Luo Ge restored the boundary of the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

22:50.500 --> 22:51.410
put down Ao Yin,

22:51.660 --> 22:53.460
and restored peace to the world.

22:54.460 --> 22:55.500
Every festival,

22:55.620 --> 22:56.860
people specifically came here.

22:56.860 --> 22:58.460
to pray for heaven lanterns.

22:58.500 --> 22:59.900
They are very religious.

23:09.940 --> 23:10.700
Tell me.

23:11.170 --> 23:12.100
The mortal world

23:12.700 --> 23:14.260
has everything in the Immortal Palace.

23:14.260 --> 23:15.460
But what is found in the mortal world

23:15.460 --> 23:17.260
may not be found in the Immortal Palace.

23:17.260 --> 23:18.300
Why

23:18.500 --> 23:20.300
does everyone want to be a fairy?

23:21.340 --> 23:21.740
Look.

23:23.500 --> 23:25.160
The beauty of the mortal world

23:25.450 --> 23:26.850
is protected by someone.

23:27.740 --> 23:29.740
In order to protect these beauties,

23:29.980 --> 23:31.440
there's Immortal Palace.

23:31.980 --> 23:33.710
and people like Marquis Wuyang

23:33.780 --> 23:35.310
striving to be an immortal.

23:36.700 --> 23:38.700
Looking at the hard life of mortals,

23:38.900 --> 23:41.100
people like us should be more diligent.

23:41.860 --> 23:43.380
You possess the Sun Spirit,

23:43.380 --> 23:44.910
which is enough to show that

23:45.060 --> 23:46.460
you are the chosen one.

23:47.620 --> 23:49.220
Don't let personal feelings

23:50.820 --> 23:52.420
hinder your progress.

23:54.820 --> 23:55.090
Yes.

23:58.780 --> 23:59.780
Destiny?

24:01.860 --> 24:03.390
What are you talking about?

24:03.620 --> 24:05.170
Luo Ge took Liu Shao to mortal world.

24:05.170 --> 24:06.500
again?

24:07.260 --> 24:07.690
Yes.

24:08.330 --> 24:09.740
Master Shang is in charge of

24:09.740 --> 24:12.740
the affairs of the Immortal Palace for the time being.

24:12.860 --> 24:13.820
Nonsense!

24:18.900 --> 24:19.830
You can go first.

24:20.180 --> 24:20.730
Yes.

24:25.980 --> 24:27.860
Luo Ge! Luo Ge!

24:28.380 --> 24:29.770
Are you crazy?

24:31.450 --> 24:33.910
You just left the Immortal Palace like this?

24:34.260 --> 24:36.660
Do you still want to be a god?

24:40.420 --> 24:40.980
No.

24:43.060 --> 24:45.660
I can't let him ruin his future like that.

24:45.980 --> 24:47.980
Wouldn't that be better?

24:49.780 --> 24:51.580
Luo Ge is in love.

24:52.260 --> 24:53.730
That's your chance.

24:54.500 --> 24:55.060
Who?

24:56.420 --> 24:56.940
Who?

24:58.140 --> 24:58.820
Who are you?

24:59.540 --> 25:00.660
Who am I?

25:02.130 --> 25:03.540
I am you.

25:04.940 --> 25:06.380
Have you forgotten

25:07.500 --> 25:09.660
what you did?

25:42.580 --> 25:43.020
No.

25:44.340 --> 25:44.900
No.

25:46.300 --> 25:47.780
I didn't do that!

25:48.540 --> 25:49.180
No!

26:08.100 --> 26:08.980
Luo Ge.

26:09.500 --> 26:11.560
You want to protect the Three Realms?

26:12.530 --> 26:13.460
Guess

26:14.210 --> 26:16.020
what gifts

26:17.220 --> 26:19.250
and surprises

26:21.570 --> 26:23.220
I have in store for you?

26:33.330 --> 26:34.340
What people want

26:34.980 --> 26:35.820
is just water

26:36.020 --> 26:36.900
and food.

26:37.330 --> 26:38.980
If there's no one to protect the world,

26:38.980 --> 26:40.780
the evil will prevail.

26:41.580 --> 26:43.640
Then the world is like the Avici Hell.

26:44.300 --> 26:47.830
A great ship can carry a heavy load. A steed can travel a long way.

26:49.700 --> 26:51.340
You have inherited Sun Spirit,

26:51.340 --> 26:53.740
so you have a responsibility in this world.

26:56.500 --> 26:58.660
I understand what you're trying to say.

26:58.660 --> 27:00.060
But, Luo Ge, do you know?

27:00.820 --> 27:02.420
It wasn't my intention

27:03.260 --> 27:04.740
to get Sun Spirit.

27:05.260 --> 27:07.740
Sometimes I feel like

27:08.410 --> 27:10.020
I'm a shadow.

27:10.140 --> 27:12.070
I have to live someone else's life.

27:12.260 --> 27:14.980
I've searched for the Baffling Star Stone from He Na.

27:14.980 --> 27:16.980
It should help you improve quickly.

27:22.180 --> 27:22.860
My Lord.

27:23.740 --> 27:24.940
What do you want to ask?

27:24.940 --> 27:25.860
Just say it.

27:26.100 --> 27:27.030
Don't hesitate.

27:28.380 --> 27:29.700
The Baffling Star Stone

27:29.700 --> 27:32.060
was supposed to boost the vitality.

27:32.380 --> 27:34.260
And Miss Liu Shao was trying to seal the divine spirit.

27:34.260 --> 27:36.590
Well, I don't think it's a good fit for her.

27:37.380 --> 27:38.380
Why did you...

27:38.940 --> 27:40.140
Liu Shao and Luo Ge.

27:40.740 --> 27:42.300
They've done so much

27:42.620 --> 27:44.480
for the peace of the Three Realms.

27:46.860 --> 27:48.220
I'm just

27:49.980 --> 27:52.640
making a small contribution to the demon world.

27:57.980 --> 27:59.540
I understand.

28:18.940 --> 28:20.140
My head is spinning.

28:20.660 --> 28:21.820
What's wrong with me?

28:21.820 --> 28:23.540
You're sick

28:23.820 --> 28:26.220
because you just sealed the divine spirit.

28:27.620 --> 28:29.750
The Master is refining the Star Stone.

28:30.660 --> 28:31.660
During this time,

28:32.020 --> 28:34.220
you need to work hard on the Crown Wheel.

28:34.340 --> 28:36.300
But you also need to pay attention to the method.

28:36.300 --> 28:38.030
If your spirit vein is damaged,

28:38.060 --> 28:40.260
the consequences may be catastrophic.

29:12.180 --> 29:13.180
What do you think?

29:13.450 --> 29:13.900
Good.

29:15.420 --> 29:16.280
I didn't expect

29:16.780 --> 29:18.090
you could make rapid progress

29:18.090 --> 29:20.090
after you sealed the divine spirit.

29:21.900 --> 29:22.580
I think

29:22.660 --> 29:24.300
it's the Crown Wheel that's helping me.

29:24.300 --> 29:26.020
After all, it's Sun's weapon.

29:26.490 --> 29:27.940
I could feel a power

29:28.060 --> 29:29.060
return to my body.

29:29.740 --> 29:31.260
If I practice enough,

29:31.530 --> 29:33.620
I'll get familiar with the power of the Crown Wheel.

29:33.620 --> 29:35.500
If anything happens to the Four Seasons Monument,

29:35.500 --> 29:36.860
I can help you.

29:40.460 --> 29:41.060
Looks like

29:42.180 --> 29:43.380
after all these days,

29:44.330 --> 29:45.860
you finally figured it out.

29:50.340 --> 29:51.180
Liu Shao.

29:52.020 --> 29:52.860
You always

29:53.260 --> 29:54.340
amaze me.

29:57.660 --> 29:59.260
I want to defend the Three Realms

29:59.260 --> 30:00.740
with you.

30:02.180 --> 30:06.240
The most important thing is that you are also the person I want to protect.

30:17.860 --> 30:20.780
They must have had a good time on earth.

30:24.050 --> 30:27.110
And I'm still waiting to ask my brother about the curse.

30:31.180 --> 30:33.140
I wonder when they'll be back.

30:35.780 --> 30:37.110
Immortal, you're back.

30:44.700 --> 30:45.290
Brother.

30:46.300 --> 30:47.500
Did you

30:48.700 --> 30:50.220
have a good time on earth these days?

30:50.220 --> 30:51.220
Tell me about it.

30:51.420 --> 30:53.260
I made this tea with freshly picked dew.

30:53.260 --> 30:53.940
Try it.

31:04.700 --> 31:05.380
It's good.

31:08.020 --> 31:09.100
I'm sure

31:09.450 --> 31:11.050
that's not why you came to me.

31:11.220 --> 31:11.680
Tell me.

31:11.820 --> 31:12.420
What is it?

31:13.020 --> 31:13.980
I think,

31:15.580 --> 31:17.220
the years of separation

31:17.660 --> 31:18.990
between the demon world

31:19.020 --> 31:21.020
and the Immortal Palace

31:21.260 --> 31:23.860
are the years of punishment for the whole race.

31:24.060 --> 31:25.320
That should be enough.

31:27.740 --> 31:29.340
This curse was put by the god.

31:30.340 --> 31:31.540
No one could break it.

31:32.740 --> 31:34.220
But the god is merciful.

31:35.260 --> 31:36.420
Even if it's a curse,

31:36.740 --> 31:39.020
there should be some leeway.

31:41.340 --> 31:42.300
You came to talk to me

31:42.300 --> 31:44.060
for Fu?

31:47.620 --> 31:48.660
Now the Four Seasons Monument

31:48.660 --> 31:49.860
is not impregnable.

31:50.380 --> 31:53.100
Liu Shao has been working on the Crown Wheel for the Four Seasons Monument.

31:53.100 --> 31:54.940
But all you do is think about that Fu.

31:54.940 --> 31:56.380
He is not a good man.

31:57.460 --> 31:58.520
Stay away from him.

31:58.540 --> 31:59.070
Brother!

31:59.450 --> 32:00.420
I don't think so!

32:00.660 --> 32:02.020
You can't say that about him!

32:02.020 --> 32:03.080
He is not a good guy,

32:03.140 --> 32:04.340
but he's not a bad guy.

32:06.540 --> 32:07.980
Get back in there right now.

32:07.980 --> 32:08.780
Grounded.

32:09.060 --> 32:09.590
Brother!

32:11.300 --> 32:12.230
Immortal Luo Ge.

32:12.580 --> 32:15.510
Master Shang is waiting for you at the Litian Temple.

32:17.970 --> 32:18.860
Brother!

32:23.660 --> 32:24.340
Hello?

32:25.260 --> 32:25.980
Brother!

32:45.220 --> 32:46.900
Well done.

32:48.060 --> 32:50.540
As long as Luo Ge returns to the Immortal Palace,

32:50.540 --> 32:53.070
he can only keep wasting his immortal energy.

32:54.530 --> 32:55.730
Every time he is weak,

32:56.980 --> 32:58.420
I'm stronger.

32:59.740 --> 33:01.600
As long as Luo Ge keeps doing this,

33:02.620 --> 33:07.940
the Three Realms will be mine sooner or later.

33:07.940 --> 33:10.200
I have practiced for ten thousand years.

33:10.290 --> 33:12.620
How could I be affected by the evil spirit?

33:13.940 --> 33:15.780
How could it be me?

33:19.060 --> 33:21.180
Immortal Master, there are cracks in the Four Seasons Monument.

33:21.180 --> 33:23.910
Master Shang asked you to go to the Litian Temple.

33:30.740 --> 33:33.860
They didn't find anything, did they?

33:36.740 --> 33:38.700
The new cracks are different from the past.

33:38.700 --> 33:40.780
They're destroyed by external forces.

33:40.780 --> 33:43.060
He could enter the Four Seasons Monument boundary

33:43.060 --> 33:44.500
and destroy the Four Seasons Monument.

33:44.500 --> 33:46.580
It must be someone inside the Immortal Palace.

33:46.580 --> 33:48.580
The disciples who died at the Four Seasons Monument

33:48.580 --> 33:50.440
should also be killed by this man.

33:52.060 --> 33:52.590
Besides,

33:53.500 --> 33:55.220
the Bone Melting Pool connects the Life Gate at the bottom of the Four Seasons Monument.

33:55.220 --> 33:57.700
There're constantly evil spirits gushing out.

33:57.700 --> 33:58.500
You are right.

33:58.980 --> 33:59.700
I always suspected

33:59.700 --> 34:02.100
there was a traitor in the Immortal Palace.

34:02.410 --> 34:03.660
He is very cunning.

34:05.500 --> 34:08.500
Although I eliminated the evil spirits of the Yin-yang cave

34:08.500 --> 34:11.260
and the Four Seasons Monument is temporarily stable,

34:11.260 --> 34:13.940
the Four Seasons Monument is not as good as before

34:13.940 --> 34:15.650
after thousands of years.

34:18.060 --> 34:19.520
I'm actually worried that

34:20.580 --> 34:22.580
if we don't get rid of the inside man,

34:22.780 --> 34:25.510
one day the Four Seasons Monument will collapse.

34:28.780 --> 34:30.980
The one under the Four Seasons Monument

34:31.020 --> 34:33.420
has always been looking for an opportunity.

34:33.420 --> 34:36.500
He wanted to send the evil spirits into the Bone Melting Pool,

34:36.500 --> 34:38.030
where they would take root.

34:38.860 --> 34:41.389
The power of the God of Moonlight was so great,

34:41.860 --> 34:44.060
but his mind was also destroyed by the evil spirit.

34:44.060 --> 34:46.460
If they accumulate too much in the Bone Melting Pool,

34:46.460 --> 34:48.060
no one in the Immortal Palace

34:48.300 --> 34:49.300
can bear it.

34:53.889 --> 34:55.500
I'll remove the evil spirits from the Bone Melting Pool

34:55.500 --> 34:56.460
myself.

34:57.500 --> 35:00.380
But you need to watch out the disciples for being invaded by the evil spirits.

35:00.380 --> 35:01.300
Don't

35:02.060 --> 35:04.780
give that guy under the Four Seasons Monument a chance.

35:04.780 --> 35:06.380
We need to get rid of that evil

35:06.540 --> 35:07.870
before we can rest easy.

35:16.260 --> 35:17.940
Xie Lingqi.

35:22.860 --> 35:25.220
We meet again.

36:23.300 --> 36:23.900
Immortal,

36:24.860 --> 36:26.060
you

36:26.420 --> 36:28.140
condensed so much evil spirits

36:28.140 --> 36:29.020
into a bead?

36:29.980 --> 36:31.980
There should be no evil spirit left.

36:32.700 --> 36:34.560
Otherwise, the Bone Melting Pool

36:35.460 --> 36:38.780
still has the chance to become a gathering place of evil spirits.

36:38.780 --> 36:41.110
But Immortal, you already have an injury.

36:42.260 --> 36:45.740
And you used the Spring to repair the Four Seasons Monument again.

36:45.740 --> 36:47.340
How do you hold up on your own?

36:48.380 --> 36:49.640
This is what he wanted.

36:51.980 --> 36:52.940
You mean he did it

36:52.940 --> 36:54.340
to wear out your aura?

36:55.660 --> 36:56.260
Immortal!

36:57.650 --> 36:58.250
Immortal!

36:58.820 --> 36:59.220
Luo Ge!

37:00.140 --> 37:01.740
The Immortal used too much spiritual power.

37:01.740 --> 37:04.670
It may have injured his inner organs and spirit vein.

37:04.940 --> 37:06.660
I'll take him out for medical treatment.

37:06.660 --> 37:07.790
Then I'll stay here.

37:08.020 --> 37:10.460
I'll keep an eye on the monster under the Four Seasons Monument.

37:10.460 --> 37:11.740
As for the inside man,

37:11.900 --> 37:13.060
if I find him,

37:13.340 --> 37:14.270
I will catch him.

37:14.780 --> 37:16.440
Okay. Thank you, General Xie.

37:25.300 --> 37:26.760
Bad brother! Bad brother!

37:26.940 --> 37:28.200
All you do is lock me up.

37:42.180 --> 37:43.740
This boundary...

38:03.940 --> 38:05.060
Oh, no.

38:06.340 --> 38:08.780
I broke my brother's boundary.

38:08.940 --> 38:10.620
How... How is that possible?

38:14.660 --> 38:15.700
Oh, my god.

38:33.020 --> 38:33.750
Don't worry.

38:34.020 --> 38:36.480
I've just had a lot of things going on lately.

38:36.580 --> 38:37.740
I just overdid it.

38:38.380 --> 38:39.460
I'll be fine

38:40.010 --> 38:41.140
if I rest for a while.

38:41.620 --> 38:42.660
Immortal,

38:42.930 --> 38:44.500
you've just recovered from this.

38:44.500 --> 38:46.030
When will your body recover

38:46.340 --> 38:49.100
after you've done such a big thing since you came back?

38:49.100 --> 38:49.980
Listen.

38:50.300 --> 38:51.760
Don't do this all the time.

38:51.980 --> 38:53.180
I can't bear it.

38:54.460 --> 38:55.580
Your body

38:55.980 --> 38:58.310
will not be able to withstand this ordeal.

38:59.580 --> 39:00.840
It's nothing serious.

39:01.500 --> 39:03.160
Anyway, Luo Ge is an Immortal.

39:04.260 --> 39:04.780
Master,

39:04.980 --> 39:05.780
come on.

39:06.500 --> 39:07.380
If you can't talk,

39:07.380 --> 39:08.300
don't talk.

39:09.010 --> 39:09.940
He's right.

39:11.180 --> 39:13.580
That vicious creature did this on purpose.

39:13.940 --> 39:14.820
It looks like

39:15.460 --> 39:17.260
it's going to do something soon.

39:19.180 --> 39:20.020
Luo Ning.

39:20.860 --> 39:22.740
Didn't your brother ground you?

39:22.860 --> 39:24.460
How did you get out?

39:25.460 --> 39:27.540
I was just gonna ask you about that.

39:27.860 --> 39:30.190
Is there something wrong with my brother?

39:30.340 --> 39:31.060
Today,

39:31.300 --> 39:33.230
I just used a little more strength.

39:33.540 --> 39:35.100
I can't believe I broke

39:35.100 --> 39:36.430
my brother's boundary.

39:40.420 --> 39:41.340
Your brother's boundary

39:41.340 --> 39:44.100
for his family is pretty arbitrary.

39:44.580 --> 39:47.640
Besides, it has something to do with his own condition.

39:47.650 --> 39:49.940
It took him a lot of effort

39:50.140 --> 39:51.700
to seal the evil spirits today.

39:51.700 --> 39:53.460
So you got a good deal.

39:55.100 --> 39:56.180
I'm glad he's fine.

39:56.980 --> 39:58.340
Then I won't visit him,

39:58.580 --> 40:00.690
lest he lock me up again.

40:01.660 --> 40:03.540
If he tries to lock you up next time,

40:03.540 --> 40:05.530
tell him I'm looking for you.

40:05.660 --> 40:06.990
You can hide in my place.

40:07.540 --> 40:08.500
You are the best.

40:10.860 --> 40:12.100
By the way, Immortal Master,

40:12.100 --> 40:13.300
there's something

40:13.300 --> 40:14.560
I want to ask you about.

40:15.140 --> 40:15.820
What is it?

40:16.220 --> 40:18.770
It has something to do with what happened in the aquatic demon world.

40:18.770 --> 40:20.020
I wonder

40:20.580 --> 40:22.220
what's going on

40:22.500 --> 40:24.160
with the aquatic demon curse.

40:28.850 --> 40:29.490
Okay.

40:29.980 --> 40:31.710
It's just as well that you know.

40:32.740 --> 40:33.460
Back then,

40:33.580 --> 40:34.900
Immortal Ze Shui

40:35.020 --> 40:37.300
learned that the man who would marry her

40:37.420 --> 40:38.660
was not the lake fairy,

40:38.660 --> 40:39.780
but the Demon King.

40:41.500 --> 40:43.900
She wanted to run away right then and there.

40:44.020 --> 40:44.980
But

40:45.180 --> 40:47.240
her immortal energy was imprisoned.

40:48.460 --> 40:51.340
So she was forced to stay in the demon world.

40:53.580 --> 40:55.420
I don't know how long it took.

40:56.020 --> 40:57.500
One day,

40:57.740 --> 41:00.660
she broke the seal with the magic weapon

41:00.980 --> 41:03.930
and came to the Brahma tree.

41:04.860 --> 41:05.540
Tree Fairy,

41:06.180 --> 41:07.380
you always thought

41:08.100 --> 41:09.630
we really loved each other.

41:10.140 --> 41:11.180
But now?

41:13.260 --> 41:14.860
Is this what happens

41:15.580 --> 41:17.260
when you really love each other?

41:17.260 --> 41:18.820
What he did

41:19.340 --> 41:21.140
was no different from a monster.

41:24.220 --> 41:27.420
The paths of the fairy and the demon are really different.

41:27.420 --> 41:27.950
Turns out

41:29.740 --> 41:31.270
what the old immortals said

41:32.020 --> 41:33.260
was right.
